  "description": "<p>A sparql-update will fail if any literal contains the string \"/&gt;\", for instance:</p>\n\n<p>PREFIX dc: &lt;<a href=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/</a>&gt;</p>\n\n<p>INSERT DATA </p>\n{ \r\n&lt;&gt; dc:title \"Some&lt;br/&gt;Text\" .\r\n}\n\n<p>This appears to be related to this ticket: <a href=\"https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1409\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-1409</a></p>\n\n<p>and this line in particular: <a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/FedoraResourceImpl.java#L444\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/FedoraResourceImpl.java#L444</a> </p>",
